{"v":1,"book":"Eccl","ch":11,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"Cast your bread upon the surface of the waters, for you will find it in many days.","tok":[{"t":"Cast","s":["H7971"],"a":[0]},{"t":" your "},{"t":"bread","s":["H3899"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"upon","s":["H6440"],"a":[3]},{"t":" the surface of the "},{"t":"waters","s":["H4325"],"a":[4]},{"t":", for you will "},{"t":"find","s":["H4672"],"a":[8]},{"t":" it in "},{"t":"many","s":["H7230"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"days","s":["H3117"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":2,"text":"Give a portion to seven, and even to eight, for you do not know what calamity will happen on the earth.","tok":[{"t":"Give","s":["H5414"],"a":[0]},{"t":" a "},{"t":"portion","s":["H2506"],"a":[1]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"seven","s":["H7651"],"a":[2]},{"t":", and even to "},{"t":"eight","s":["H8083"],"a":[4]},{"t":", for you do not "},{"t":"know","s":["H3045"],"a":[7]},{"t":" what calamity will happen on the "},{"t":"earth","s":["H0776"],"a":[12]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"If the clouds are full, they pour forth rain on the earth; and whether a tree falls toward the south or toward the north, in the place where the tree falls, there will it be.","tok":[{"t":"If the "},{"t":"clouds","s":["H5645"],"a":[2]},{"t":" are "},{"t":"full","s":["H4390"],"a":[1]},{"t":", they pour forth "},{"t":"rain","s":["H1653"],"a":[3]},{"t":" on the "},{"t":"earth","s":["H0776"],"a":[5]},{"t":"; and whether a "},{"t":"tree","s":["H6086"],"a":[9]},{"t":" "},{"t":"falls","s":["H5307"],"a":[8]},{"t":" toward the "},{"t":"south","s":["H1864"],"a":[10]},{"t":" or toward the "},{"t":"north","s":["H6828"],"a":[12]},{"t":", in the "},{"t":"place","s":["H4725"],"a":[13]},{"t":" where the "},{"t":"tree","s":["H6086"],"a":[15]},{"t":" "},{"t":"falls","s":["H5307"],"a":[14]},{"t":", there will it "},{"t":"be","s":["H1933"],"a":[17]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":4,"text":"He who watches the wind will not sow, and he who looks at the clouds will not reap.","tok":[{"t":"He who watches the "},{"t":"wind","s":["H7307"],"a":[1]},{"t":" will not "},{"t":"sow","s":["H2232"],"a":[3]},{"t":", and he who looks at the "},{"t":"clouds","s":["H5645"],"a":[5]},{"t":" will not "},{"t":"reap","s":["H7114"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":5,"text":"Just as you do not know what the path of the wind is or how the bones are formed in the mother’s womb, so you do not know the work of God, who makes everything.","tok":[{"t":"Just as you do not "},{"t":"know","s":["H3045"],"a":[2]},{"t":" what the path of the wind is or how the "},{"t":"bones","s":["H6106"],"a":[6]},{"t":" are formed in the mother’s "},{"t":"womb","s":["H0990"],"a":[7]},{"t":", so you do not "},{"t":"know","s":["H3045"],"a":[11]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"work","s":["H4639"],"a":[13]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[14]},{"t":", who "},{"t":"makes","s":["H6213"],"a":[16]},{"t":" everything."}]},{"n":6,"text":"In the morning sow your seed, and in the evening do not hold back your hands; for you do not know which will prosper, this one or that, or whether both alike will be good.","tok":[{"t":"In the "},{"t":"morning","s":["H1242"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"sow","s":["H2232"],"a":[1]},{"t":" your "},{"t":"seed","s":["H2233"],"a":[3]},{"t":", and in the "},{"t":"evening","s":["H6153"],"a":[4]},{"t":" do not hold back your "},{"t":"hands","s":["H3027"],"a":[7]},{"t":"; for you do not "},{"t":"know","s":["H3045"],"a":[10]},{"t":" which "},{"t":"will","s":["H0335"],"a":[11]},{"t":" "},{"t":"prosper","s":["H3787"],"a":[13]},{"t":", this one or that, or "},{"t":"whether","s":["H0335"],"a":[11]},{"t":" "},{"t":"both","s":["H8147"],"a":[18]},{"t":" "},{"t":"alike","s":["H0259"],"a":[19]},{"t":" will be "},{"t":"good","s":["H2896"],"a":[20]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":7,"text":"The light is sweet, and it is pleasant for the eyes to see the sun.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"light","s":["H0216"],"a":[1]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"sweet","s":["H4966"],"a":[0]},{"t":", and it is "},{"t":"pleasant","s":["H2896"],"a":[2]},{"t":" for the "},{"t":"eyes","s":["H5869"],"a":[3]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"see","s":["H7200"],"a":[4]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"sun","s":["H8121"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":8,"text":"Indeed if a man should live many years, let him rejoice in all of them; but let him remember the days of darkness, for they will be many. All that comes is vanity.","tok":[{"t":"Indeed if a "},{"t":"man","s":["H0120"],"a":[5]},{"t":" should "},{"t":"live","s":["H2421"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"many","s":["H7235"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"years","s":["H8141"],"a":[2]},{"t":", let him "},{"t":"rejoice","s":["H8055"],"a":[7]},{"t":" in all of them; but let him "},{"t":"remember","s":["H2142"],"a":[8]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"days","s":["H3117"],"a":[10]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"darkness","s":["H2822"],"a":[11]},{"t":", for they will be "},{"t":"many","s":["H7235"],"a":[13]},{"t":". All that "},{"t":"comes","s":["H0935"],"a":[16]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"vanity","s":["H1892"],"a":[17]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":9,"text":"Rejoice, young man, in your childhood, and let your heart be merry in the days of your youth; and walk in the ways of your heart and in the sight of your eyes. But know that for all these things God will bring you to judgment.","tok":[{"t":"Rejoice","s":["H8055"],"a":[0]},{"t":", young "},{"t":"man","s":["H0970"],"a":[1]},{"t":", in your childhood, and let your "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3820"],"a":[4]},{"t":" be "},{"t":"merry","s":["H2895"]},{"t":" in the "},{"t":"days","s":["H3117"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of your "},{"t":"youth","s":["H0979"],"a":[6]},{"t":"; and "},{"t":"walk","s":["H1980"],"a":[7]},{"t":" in the "},{"t":"ways","s":["H1870"],"a":[8]},{"t":" of your "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3820"],"a":[9]},{"t":" and in the "},{"t":"sight","s":["H4758"],"a":[10]},{"t":" of your "},{"t":"eyes","s":["H5869"],"a":[11]},{"t":". But "},{"t":"know","s":["H3045"],"a":[12]},{"t":" that for all these things "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[18]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"bring","s":["H0935"],"a":[17]},{"t":" you to "},{"t":"judgment","s":["H4941"],"a":[19]},{"t":"